SUMMARY:Deadline: JSK Journalism Fellowship 2027-28 (John S. Knight Fellows
 hips at Stanford)
DESCRIPTION:Stanford's nine-month residential fellowship for journalists an
 d people who work in service of journalism (editors\, producers\, photogra
 phers\, audience and community builders\, publishers\, operations and stra
 tegy staff).\n\nOrganisation: John S. Knight Journalism Fellowships at Sta
 nford\nLocation: Stanford\, California\, USA (residential 9-month fellowsh
 ip). Citizens of countries where the US has suspended J visa issuance cann
 ot be offered a fellowship unless they apply with another unrestricted cit
 izenship.\nAward: USD 135\,000 stipend for nine months\, plus Stanford tui
 tion and health insurance and a health supplement for dependents on Stanfo
 rd coverage. No application fee.\nDuration: 9 months in residence at Stanf
 ord\, September 2027 to May 2028\n\nMore: https://jsk.stanford.edu/become-
 a-fellow?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://jsk.stanford.edu/become-a-fellow?utm_source=artificialnouveaugr
 antdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Stanford\, California\, USA (residential 9-month fellowship). Citi
 zens of countries where the US has suspended J visa issuance cannot be off
 ered a fellowship unless they apply with another unrestricted citizenship.
END:VEVENT
